{"unit_id": "tag:01WG:title", "translation": "整（Integral）与有限（finite）态射（morphisms）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "节标题中的第一类态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "节标题中的第二类态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "节标题所讨论的概形间的箭头"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WG:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，称环同态（ring map）<MATH_0001>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>整（integral）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若<MATH_0002>的每个元素（element）都满足一个首一方程（monic equation），其系数（coefficients）在<MATH_0003>中。\n回顾一下，称环同态（ring map）<MATH_0004>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>有限（finite）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若<MATH_0005>是有限（finite）的<MATH_0006>-模（module）。\n见代数（Algebra）一章的定义<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "monic equation", "target_term": "首一方程"}, {"source_term": "coefficients", "target_term": "系数"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "回顾第一种环同态的定义"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "由首一方程刻画的环同态性质"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "环中的任一成员"}, {"source_term": "monic equation", "target_term": "首一方程", "context": "首项系数为一的方程"}, {"source_term": "coefficients", "target_term": "系数", "context": "方程的系数所属的环"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "回顾第二种环同态的定义"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "由模的有限性刻画的环同态性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "作为模的有限性"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "目标环作为源环上的模"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "被引用的章节名称"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WH:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>整（integral）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若<MATH_0003>是仿射（affine）的，且对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>，记其逆（inverse）像（image）为<MATH_0005>，相应的环同态（ring map）<MATH_0006>都是整（integral）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称<MATH_0007>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>有限（finite）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若<MATH_0008>是仿射（affine）的，且对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0009>，记其逆（inverse）像（image）为<MATH_0010>，相应的环同态（ring map）<MATH_0011>都是有限（finite）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义所讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "待定义的第一种态射性质"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第一种定义中对态射的条件"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "目标中的仿射开部分"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "和下一词组成逆像"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "逆像一词的后半部分"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "从仿射开集及其逆像得到的环同态"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第一种定义中对环同态的条件"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "待定义的第二种态射性质"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第二种定义中对态射的条件"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "目标中的仿射开部分"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "和下一词组成逆像"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "逆像一词的后半部分"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "从仿射开集及其逆像得到的环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第二种定义中对环同态的条件"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WG:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n显然，整（integral）态射和有限（finite）态射（morphisms）都是分离（separated）且拟紧（quasi-compact）的。显然，有限（finite）态射（morphism）也是有限型（finite type）的态射（morphism）。本节大多数引理都是完全标准的。不过，请留意本节末尾有趣的引理<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第一类态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第二类态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "这里同时讨论整态射和有限态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "两类态射共有的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "两类态射共有的另一性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第二句的前提"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二句的主语"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "有限态射具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二句结论中的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02K8:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是整（integral）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在一个由仿射开集（affine open）组成的覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，使得每个<MATH_0004>都是仿射（affine）的，且<MATH_0005>是整（integral）的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使得每个<MATH_0007>都是整（integral）的。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n此外，若<MATH_0008>是整（integral）的，则对每个开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0009>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>都是整（integral）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "各条件互相蕴含"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "首项条件中的箭头"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "首项条件中的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "覆盖的成员"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "由仿射开集构成的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第二项中每个相应对象的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二项中的性质"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第三项所用的开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第三项中的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "附加结论的前提"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "限制态射的目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "限制所得的箭头"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "限制所得的态射仍具备的性质"}], "notes": []}
