{"unit_id": "tag:01WI:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是有限（finite）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在一个由仿射开集（affine open）组成的覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，使得每个<MATH_0004>都是仿射（affine）的，且<MATH_0005>是有限（finite）的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使得每个<MATH_0007>都是有限（finite）的。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n此外，若<MATH_0008>是有限（finite）的，则对每个开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0009>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>都是有限（finite）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "各条件互相蕴含"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "首项条件中的箭头"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "首项条件中的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "覆盖的成员"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "由仿射开集构成的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第二项中每个相应对象的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第二项中的性质"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_