{"unit_id": "tag:01WJ:statement", "translation": "有限（finite）态射（morphism）是整（integral）的。\n整（integral）态射（morphism）若是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，则是有限（finite）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "首句对态射的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "首句讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "首句得出的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "次句对态射的第一个假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "次句讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "次句对态射的附加条件"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "次句得出的性质"}], "notes": []}
