{"unit_id": "tag:01WK:statement", "translation": "有限（finite）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）是有限（finite）的。整（integral）态射（morphisms）也有同样的性质。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "参与复合的态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的箭头"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "由各个态射得到一个态射的运算"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "复合所得态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "次句所讨论的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "次句中可作复合的箭头"}], "notes": []}
