{"unit_id": "tag:02NT:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为整（integral）态射（morphism）。则<MATH_0002>的每个点（point）在其所在的纤维（fibre）中都是闭（closed）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "态射所满足的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "考察其闭性的对象"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "考察该点闭性所在的纤维"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "纤维中该点的性质"}], "notes": []}
