{"unit_id": "tag:0ECG:proof", "translation": "由于<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>的维数（dimension）各自是一个由仿射开集（affine open）组成的覆盖（covering）中各成员的维数（dimensions）的上确界（supremum），可假设<MATH_0003>与<MATH_0004>都是仿射（affine）的。不等式（inequality）由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0001>推出。等式（equality）则由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>推出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "dimensions", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "supremum", "target_term": "上确界"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "inequality", "target_term": "不等式"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "所给两个对象的维数"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "构成覆盖的开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "用来计算维数的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "dimensions", "target_term": "维数", "context": "各覆盖成员的维数"}, {"source_term": "supremum", "target_term": "上确界", "context": "由各成员的维数取出的量"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "化归后可作的假设"}, {"source_term": "inequality", "target_term": "不等式", "context": "引理的第一项结论"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "首处引用的章节名称"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "引理的第二项结论"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "再次引用的章节名称"}], "notes": []}
