{"unit_id": "tag:02NU:proof", "translation": "这由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0001>和引理<REF_0002>推出。也可以由引理<REF_0003>（以及有限（finite）态射（morphism）是整（integral）的这一事实）得知，纤维（fibres）中的所有点（points）都是闭点（closed points），再用引理<REF_0004>的第（3）项得知，<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>处是拟有限（quasi-finite）的，对所有<MATH_0003>皆然。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第一种证明中引用的章节名称"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "另一种证明所用的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用来断言整性的箭头"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "由有限性得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "考察各点所在的纤维"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "逐一考察其闭性的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "在所在纤维中为闭的点"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "逐点推出的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WN:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是有限（finite）的；\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003>是仿射（affine）且真（proper）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "真"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "两项条件互相推出"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一项的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第二项中的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "真", "context": "第二项中的第二种性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WN:proof", "translation": "这可由引理<REF_0001>和以下事实形式地推出：有限（finite）态射（morphism）是整（integral）且分离（separated）的；真态射（proper morphism）就是有限型（finite type）、分离（separated）且普遍闭（universally closed）的态射（morphism）；有限型（finite type）的整（integral）态射（morphism）是有限（finite）的（引理<REF_0002>）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "真态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一项事实的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项事实所讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第一项事实所得的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "第一项事实所得的第二种性质"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "真态射", "context": "第二项事实所刻画的箭头"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "刻画真态射的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "刻画真态射的第二种性质"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "刻画真态射的第三种性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二项事实中用于刻画真态射的箭头"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "第三项事实中对整态射的附加条件"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第三项事实的整性假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三项事实所讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第三项事实的结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:035C:statement", "translation": "闭浸入（closed immersion）是有限（finite）的（因而更是整（integral）的）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "引理讨论的浸入"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "闭浸入的直接结论"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "由有限性进一步得到的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:035C:proof", "translation": "这是因为闭浸入（closed immersion）是仿射（affine）的（引理<REF_0001>），而满射（surjective）的环同态（ring map）是有限（finite）且整（integral）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "以仿射性化为环同态的浸入"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "由引理得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "环同态的假设"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "仿射情形所用的同态"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "由满射性得到的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "由满射性得到的第二种性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0CYI:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）之间的有限（finite）态射（morphisms）。则<MATH_0003>也是有限（finite）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "两个态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "两个给定态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的两个箭头"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第三个箭头的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0CYI:proof", "translation": "这由如下代数（algebra）事实推出：若<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>是有限（finite）环同态（ring maps），则<MATH_0003>也是有限（finite）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引用事实所属的领域"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "两个给定环同态的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "代数事实中的两个同态"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "代数事实中第三个同态的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:035D:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>为态射（morphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0003>是有限（finite）的且<MATH_0004>是分离（separated）的，则<MATH_0005>是有限（finite）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0006>是整（integral）的且<MATH_0007>是分离（separated）的，则<MATH_0008>是整（integral）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的两个箭头"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一项的首个假设"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "第一项的第二个假设"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一项的结论"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二项的首个假设"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "第二项的第二个假设"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二项的结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:035D:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>是有限（finite）的（相应地，是<SPACE_0001>整（integral）的），且<MATH_0002>是分离（separated）的。基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是有限（finite）的（相应地，是<SPACE_0002>整（integral）的），见引理<REF_0001>。态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是闭浸入（closed immersion），因为<MATH_0005>是分离（separated）的，见概形（Schemes）一章的引理<REF_0002>。闭浸入（closed immersion）是有限（finite）的（相应地，是<SPACE_0003>整（integral）的），见引理<REF_0003>。有限（finite）的（相应地，<SPACE_0004>整（integral）的）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）是有限（finite）的（相应地，是<SPACE_0005>整（integral）的），见引理<REF_0004>。于是得到所需结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一种情形的假设"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二种情形的假设"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "两种情形共有的假设"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "用于分解所考察箭头的基变换"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一种情形下基变换所得的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二种情形下基变换所得的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用分离性处理的箭头"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "由分离性得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "推出闭浸入所用的性质"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "被引用的章节名称"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "应用引理的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一种情形下闭浸入的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二种情形下闭浸入的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一种情形下参与复合的箭头的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二种情形下参与复合的箭头的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的箭头"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "得到所考察箭头的运算"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一种情形下复合所得的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "第二种情形下复合所得的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03BB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>是有限（finite）的且为单态射（monomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "对该态射的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射", "context": "对该态射的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "引理断言的浸入类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03BB:proof", "translation": "这归结为代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "被引用的章节名称"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0B3I:statement", "translation": "有限（finite）态射（morphism）是射影（projective）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "引理的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理讨论的箭头"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "引理所得的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
